	(text "AP63203: fixed 3.3V, 500kHz, EN tied to VIN.\n4.7uH gives ~0.52A ripple at 5.25V input.\nBootstrap capacitor returns to SW, not ground.\nRoute feedback from output caps; minimize hot loop area."
